{"en": "1047560199", "title": "COMMENT TRAITER L'ÉCHANTILLON", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "506f5a390e5c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étape de traitement initial"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2e69f2fe2672"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le deuxième niveau est le traitement initial. Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Initial Processing. ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Cette étape consiste à saisir les paramètres de centrifugation et d'aliquotage, puis à marquer les échantillons comme traités."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4976ea9617f1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarque : seuls les échantillons terminés à l'étape Sample Reception apparaissent à l'étape Initial Processing."}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info", "localId": "9b69488431a2"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "90336b0640c4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Seuls les échantillons terminés à l'étape Sample Reception apparaissent à l'étape Initial Processing."}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "c41e57395513", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "583ba3c275b5"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8126d467f92b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Initial Processing", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-065552.png", "id": "b9cddf0e-aa80-4380-b07d-322900579cdd", "collection": "contentId-1047560199", "type": "file", "localId": "734e98d8bd94", "height": 232}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "87a7983855b4", "order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7168b54b2c31"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d3338203e463"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionnez tous les échantillons"}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-065622.png", "id": "5f2eb0a3-50f5-446e-9e12-e751ea1663bf", "collection": "contentId-1047560199", "type": "file", "localId": "7863e6a578ed", "height": 233}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "519f8c161d9e", "order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "88b07023dd20"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "93faa00b182b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Une fois les échantillons sélectionnés, cliquez sur le bouton Bulk apply Values. Dans cet exemple, seuls trois échantillons ont été sélectionnés pour la "}, {"type": "text", "text": "centrifugation.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-065641.png", "id": "fdb2b755-3acb-4051-a266-b36e39a180df", "collection": "contentId-1047560199", "type": "file", "localId": "20a53bb19cb0", "height": 235}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "8161d39700a5", "order": 4}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "4307fc5eebd9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "0587dba8a193"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cochez les champs à appliquer à tous les échantillons sélectionnés."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-065701.png", "id": "8795013a-547f-4cf3-9572-34fbc323c2e6", "collection": "contentId-1047560199", "type": "file", "localId": "d3524c09b676", "height": 233}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ab54657913f0"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Notez que les 11 champs vont être appliqués aux trois échantillons."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-065719.png", "id": "336f852b-2607-477f-8b6a-939bee38740b", "collection": "contentId-1047560199", "type": "file", "localId": "7ef345f67aca", "height": 233}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "5b6dcdd92766", "order": 5}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "b227eddc35d4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ed4f4fe2edc9"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Apply to Selected", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-065807.png", "id": "9f7c529a-3e28-43e6-a142-025cae997f86", "collection": "contentId-1047560199", "type": "file", "localId": "2a08e2dce9c9", "height": 233}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "be01b83993a9"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le statut passe à "}, {"type": "text", "text": "In Progress.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-065823.png", "id": "7a892c1b-d6b0-4dd2-8b46-f3f7e64b0767", "collection": "contentId-1047560199", "type": "file", "localId": "55a4bf333188", "height": 234}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "317ded7d264b", "order": 6}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7aeebb923903"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "35416ee6b923"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lorsque les saisies vous conviennent, sélectionnez les échantillons et cliquez sur le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Mark Selected as Processed ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-065841.png", "id": "28f824b6-7853-4931-9017-da52c8ca1573", "collection": "contentId-1047560199", "type": "file", "localId": "72c1a24a9394", "height": 234}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ee76547c163e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le statut passe à "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Terminé", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "completed", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") pour les trois échantillons. Les autres sont en attente."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-065858.png", "id": "13b80709-83d6-4a0f-8072-ccda22e2973b", "collection": "contentId-1047560199", "type": "file", "localId": "81795fae48f6", "height": 235}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "bb1b655acda2"}}], "version": 1}}